# README style

- Pragmatic, technical, direct. No marketing language; prefer bullets and short sections.
- One-line value proposition near the top.
- State support scope explicitly (OS, architecture, .NET version, supported PS5LM variants and versions).
- Include a quick start, exact build prerequisites and deterministic build steps.
- State support boundaries and unsupported scenarios; the issue tracker is not a help desk.
- Credit dependencies and related projects; include licence and trademark disclaimers.
